obs A guard on the roster catches drift on the next lap that RUNS it, never on a lap that says it did. The prior log recorded era_suite=12 GREEN while the suite was red on that same tree; the number was recited from the lap before.
obs A row and its headline are one edit. The reds ledger is the only pin in the tree that counts itself, so a row written without moving the count leaves the file disagreeing with its own first sentence.
obs door_admits is the widest family this arc has lifted and it opened nothing, because the cost lived in the harness's own import list rather than in any rung. The meter measured the rungs correctly and a reader had to look at line 48 to know the answer was free.
